{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder without image data or fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464. This performance is lower than multimodal baselines (~0.52 accuracy), suggesting potential incremental value from image data. However, the necessity of image data and the optimality of pca_n2000 remain uncertain due to lack of direct comparisons with alternative encoders or fusion strategies."
}

